    "https://txwes.peopleadmin.com/postings/6460": {
      "title": "Texas Wesleyan University Portal",
      "description": "Texas Wesleyan University Portal | Athletic Training Work-Study (4 Positions) Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Contact Us Athletic Training Work-Study (4 Positions) Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Position Information Job Title Athletic Training Work-Study (4 Positions) Position Summary The chosen candidate will assist the Athletic Training Staff in daily duties both on and off campus. The chosen candidate will not provide any form of medical care to any student-athletes. Essential Duties and Responsibilities - The chosen candidate will assist the Athletic Training Staff in the following: - Cleaning treatment tables. - Cleaning rehabilitation spaces. - Cleaning coolers; cleaning water bottles. - Cleaning rehabilitation equipment. - Helping student athletes sign-in for treatments. - Taking inventory of supplies. - Organizing supplies. - Filing paperwork. - Making copies. - Carrying equipment. Education, Certifications and/or Licenses Experience No Experience needed Knowledge, Skills & Abilities Basic knowledge of filing is helpful Knowledge of the human anatomy and movement. Ability to think critically. Ability to be thorough and detailed in tracking athletes and their care. Ability to communicate. Must have the ability to organize, prioritize, and perform multiple tasks. Ability to be discrete in handling confidential matters while complying with privacy regulations, e.g. FERPA , HIPPA etc. Ability to adhere to and support University & departmental policies and procedures. Ability to carry up to 80lbs Ability to work in different weather conditions, extreme heat or cold. Ability to stand for long periods of time Ability to work in the afternoon, nights, and weekends as per course schedule allows. Ability to work in loud environments. Basic knowledge of filing is helpful Posting Detail Information Posting Number Posting Open Date 08/03/2026 Open Until Filled Posting Close Date Special Instructions to Applicants Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Are you currently enrolled as a student at Texas Wesleyan University? Yes No Do you qualify for Federal work study? yes no How  many years of Administrative support experience do you have? 0-2 3-5 6-9 10 or more Are you available to work in the evening (6 pm to 10 pm)? Yes No Are you available to work weekends? Yes No Documents Needed To Apply Required Documents Class Schedule (Student Employment Only) Financial Aid Work Study Award Letter (Student Employment Only) Optional Documents Resume Cover Letter Letter of Recommendation 1201 Wesleyan Street Fort Worth, TX 76105 | 817-531-4444 ©2016 Texas Wesleyan University. All rights reserved. To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
