book-reading and note-taking strategies. Knowledge in college campus resources. Knowledge in different earning styles. Knowledge in test-taking approaches and preparation strategies. Ability to work effectively with other University personnel. Ability to provide service to both the University and the community. Ability to comply with rules, standards, regulations, FERPA laws, and laws related to student records. Ability to adhere to university and departmental policies and procedures. Ability to use discretion in handling confidential and sensitive matters. Posting Detail Information Posting Number 2016AS674P Posting Open Date Open Until Filled Posting Close Date Special Instructions to Applicants Current full-time Texas Wesleyan University employee. Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Are you a current employee of the university? Yes No Documents Needed To Apply Required Documents Resume Cover Letter Current Employee Application (for internal applicants) Transcripts Letter of Recommendation Curriculum Vitae Optional Documents 1201 Wesleyan Street Fort Worth, TX 76105 | 817-531-4444 ©2016 Texas Wesleyan University. All rights reserved. To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
