    "https://txwes.peopleadmin.com/postings/6481": {
      "title": "Texas Wesleyan University Portal | Alumni Relations Assistant",
      "description": "Texas Wesleyan University Portal | Alumni Relations Assistant Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Contact Us Alumni Relations Assistant Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Position Information Job Title Alumni Relations Assistant Position Summary The Texas Wesleyan University Office of Alumni Relations is seeking a work-study student assistant. Under the direction of the Director of Alumni Relations this part-time position is responsible for assisting with the planning and creation of department communications and events. 12-15 hours per week. Essential Duties and Responsibilities ·         Assist with event planning, set-up and take-down for the office of advancement and alumni relations ·         Assist with creation and implementation of news stories, email communications and the monthly alumni newsletter ·         Assist with the creation of social media strategy and post to alumni social media platforms – Facebook, Instagram and LinkedIn ·         Assist with alumni mailings ·         Assist with administrative duties of the alumni office ·         Provide excellent customer service when answer incoming office phone calls and with campus guests Education, Certifications and/or Licenses Must maintain a GPA of 2.5 or higher to be considered for the position Experience Freshman or higher classification at the time of official start date. Knowledge, Skills & Abilities ·         Customer service and people skills ·         Ideal candidate will have the ability to write and/or edit promotional material for alumni events and program postings ·         Graphic design ability using Canva or Adobe preferred ·         Proficient knowledge of Facebook, Instagram and LinkedIn ·         Ability to handle confidential information appropriately Posting Detail Information Posting Number Posting Open Date Open Until Filled Yes Posting Close Date Special Instructions to Applicants Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you eligible for Work Study? Yes No * Are you available to work during the hours 8am to 5pm, Monday through Friday? Yes No * Are you available to work in the evening (6 pm to 10 pm)? Yes No * Are you available to work weekends? Yes No * Can you work 15-20 hours per week Yes No * Please select your current classification: Freshman Sophomore Junior Senior * List all languages you speak fluently other than English (if any): (Open Ended Question) Documents Needed To Apply Required Documents Class Schedule (Student Employment Only) Optional Documents Resume Cover Letter Transcripts Financial Aid Work Study Award Letter (Student Employment Only) 1201 Wesleyan Street Fort Worth, TX 76105 | 817-531-4444 ©2016 Texas Wesleyan University. All rights reserved. To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
