    "https://txwes.peopleadmin.com/postings/6466": {
      "title": "Texas Wesleyan University Portal | Library Circulation Student Assistant - Tuesday and Thursday 4pm to 10pm",
      "description": "Texas Wesleyan University Portal | Library Circulation Student Assistant - Tuesday and Thursday 4pm to 10pm Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Contact Us Library Circulation Student Assistant - Tuesday and Thursday 4pm to 10pm Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Position Information Job Title Library Circulation Student Assistant - Tuesday and Thursday 4pm to 10pm Position Summary This position is required to be available to work: Tuesday and Thursday from 4pm to 10pm. -Provide clerical and receptionist support for the West library. -Provide outstanding customer service. -Process incoming and outgoing materials. -Provide basic computer and copier assistance. -Shelving of books and materials. -Inventory books and materials to maintain good order of the stacks. -Cleaning throughout the library. Essential Duties and Responsibilities -Must be detail-oriented and be able to follow verbal and written instructions. -Perform special projects and other duties as assigned. -Excellent oral and written communication skills. -Must be proactive and able to engage with a diverse constituency. -Demonstrate decision-making and problem-solving skills. -Perform other duties and responsibilities as assigned Education, Certifications and/or Licenses - High school diploma or general education degree ( GED ) required - Some college preferred Experience - Computer experience - Experience in a higher education setting preferred Knowledge, Skills & Abilities -Knowledge of Microsoft Office -Knowledge of standard office practices and procedures, including filing Posting Detail Information Posting Number Posting Open Date Open Until Filled Posting Close Date Special Instructions to Applicants Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Are you currently enrolled as a student at Texas Wesleyan University? Yes No Are you a current employee of the university? Yes No Have you worked in an academic library before? Yes No Have you ever worked on Campus before? Yes No Documents Needed To Apply Required Documents Class Schedule (Student Employment Only) Optional Documents Resume Cover Letter Financial Aid Work Study Award Letter (Student Employment Only) 1201 Wesleyan Street Fort Worth, TX 76105 | 817-531-4444 ©2016 Texas Wesleyan University. All rights reserved. To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
